Subject: [PATCH 1036/3799] soh: rename func_808A1800 ->
 BgMoriElevator_StepToward

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: steps *pValue toward target by a fraction of the remaining distance, clamped between minStep and maxStep and never overshooting; returns the step actually taken.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Mori_Elevator/z_bg_mori_elevator.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../ovl_Bg_Mori_Elevator/z_bg_mori_elevator.c     | 15 ++++++++-------
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Mori_Elevator/z_bg_mori_elevator.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Mori_Elevator/z_bg_mori_elevator.c
